{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your base. Raid the enemy. Conquer the stars.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense game with a raiding twist: build or upgrade powerful fortifications, balance your economy, launch daring raids, and explore space for lost relics and advanced technologies. Every run offers new strategies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/4448536ca91901cbc82d1f5a3cb0db8d.avif?t=1758904920\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is in turmoil. Hostile forces of Nova Roma corp. close in on your stronghold, wave after wave, determined to see your defenses crumble. But you are not just a defender \u2014 you are a raider, a builder, and an explorer of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this blend of <strong>tower defense, strategy, and roguelike</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Will you invest in your economy, strengthen your defenses, or strike boldly at your enemies before they overwhelm you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend and Raid</strong><br>Hold the line against relentless attackers while seizing opportunities to raid enemy positions and harvest their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Stars</strong> <br>Dispatch expeditions into the unknown to uncover rare relics and alien technologies that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/1c13d79ec8756ead185bdcaaeab55af9.avif?t=1758904920\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Mastery</strong><br>Balance your spending between economy, attack, and defense. The path you choose will determine whether your base thrives or falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and New Technologies</strong><br>Unlock advanced towers, shields, drones, and powerful upgrades to outlast ever-stronger waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenges</strong><br>No two runs are alike. Each playthrough brings new threats, new relics, and new ways to build your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/509c2f63e1c20d451806bd3117bc97c2.avif?t=1758904920\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of your planet lies in your hands. <strong>Will you be the fortress that stands eternal \u2014 or will you be just another corporate slave?\u00a0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933210?t=1758904920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/58c03b65b19ca2e83d7c7b84231484ba7c2019b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758904920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/2144916dada430af63b3c046179a06a19650a080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758904920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/2144916dada430af63b3c046179a06a19650a080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758904920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id